    <briefdescription>
<para>LLM → Parser → Retry validation pipeline for AQL generation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encapsulates the complete NL-to-validated-AQL workflow with automatic retry logic.</para>
<para>WORKFLOW:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>NL query arrives → LLM generates AQL</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AQL sent to parser for validation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If parser succeeds: return validated AQL</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If parser fails: format error as feedback → retry LLM with corrective prompt</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Repeat until: success OR max_retries exhausted</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>ThemisDB Team </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-06-18 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
